{
  "format": "batterydisplay-device-pack",
  "version": 1,
  "devices": [
    {
      "key": "atk-a9-plus",
      "name": "ATK 蜻蜓 A9 Plus",
      "type": "mouse",
      "transport": {
        "type": "hid",
        "io": "output_input"
      },
      "match": {
        "vid": "0x373B",
        "pid": "0x1216",
        "usage_page": "0xFF05",
        "interface": 2,
        "product_string": "NK mouse NANO dongle"
      },
      "read": {
        "query": ["08 7D 72 02 00 01 07 01"],
        "pad_to": 64,
        "checksum": {
          "mode": "none"
        },
        "attempts": 3,
        "listen_ms": 800,
        "reply": {
          "contains": ["72 00 05"],
          "battery": {
            "byte": 7
          },
          "range": [1, 100],
          "aux": {
            "voltage": {
              "byte": 8,
              "bytes": 2,
              "order": "little",
              "scale": 0.001
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "verified": {
        "date": "2026-11-21",
        "samples": [[58, 3.952], [58, 3.952], [58, 3.952], [58, 3.952]],
        "raw_reply": "08 72 00 05 00 07 01 3A 70 0F 00 00 ..."
      },
      "notes": [
        "query 的第一个字节 08 是 HID Report ID，必须原样发送",
        "Feature Report (HidD_GetFeature) 在该接口上不可用，必须走 write + read 的中断传输",
        "interface 1 的 usage_page 0xFFB3 与 interface 2 的 0xFFB1 发送后无回包",
        "电量与电压两个字段互相印证：0x3A=58%，0x0F70 小端=3952mV",
        "2026-11-21 实测 4 次读数完全稳定，尚未与 ATK HUB 界面显示值做交叉核对"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
